  "body": "# Mending Buff Plugin\n\nThis plugin allows you to **buff Mending** in a configurable way.\n\n## Configuration\n\nIn the `config.yml`, simply change the `mending-multiplier` to the multiplier of the vanilla value you want.  \n\n**Example:**  \nIf you want Mending to repair 4× as much, set:\n\n```yaml\nmending-multiplier: 4.0\n```",
